 NCE AFTERPARTY
DESCRIPTION:Toronto's BIGGEST Language Exchange Social Event + Class\n# 
 🎄 SPECIAL 5 LIVE DJ 🎧CHRISTMAS RAVE DANCE MUSIC AFTERPARTY ❤️‍
 🔥\n\n***Toronto\, let's make this Christmas louder!***\n\n***[SPECIAL E
 VENT HOSTED BY THE SANCTUARY RAVE COMMUNITY X TILE. (TORONTO INTERNATIONAL
  LANGUAGE EXCHANGE)](https://www.opentable.ca/booking/experiences-availabi
 lity?rid=1090123&experienceId=852309&shareReferrer=we)***\n\nJoin us for t
 he official **TILE (Toronto International Language Exchange) Christmas Aft
 erparty** with **The Sanctuary Rave Community** for an unforgettable night
  of electronic dance music\, festive vibes\, plenty of friends\, and inter
 national connections.\n\nThis special XMAS 5 DJ afterparty takes place fro
 m 10 PM - 2 AM at **LOBSTER BURGER BAR (214 KING STREET)** immediately aft
 er TILE's regular Saturday TILE Language Exchange social which takes place
  at a different venue from TILE's usual spot: the Madison Pub (7 PM–10 P
 M).\n\nCome meet people\, practise languages\, make international friends\
 , and then keep the celebrations going on the dance floor!\n\n**[GET YOUR 
 TICKETS HERE (includes 1 festive drink).](https://www.opentable.ca/booking
 /experiences-availability?rid=1090123&experienceId=852309&shareReferrer=we
 )**\n\n### 🎧 FIVE LIVE DJs – ONE EPIC NIGHT!\n\nGet ready for an incr
 edible lineup featuring four live DJs:\n🔥 **ERL**\n🔥 **DJ Fly**\n
 🔥 **Better with Friends (Brent & Dave)**\n🔥 **Ukai**\n\nExpect elect
 ronic dance music\, energetic beats\, dazzling lights\, Christmas decorati
 ons\, and a packed dance floor!\n\n**EVENT RULES** : **NO SMOKING. NO VAPI
 NG. NO FRAGRANCE.**\n\n### ✨ WHAT'S INCLUDED?\n\n🎧 Four live DJs play
 ing electronic dance music\n🎄 A festive Christmas rave atmosphere\n🥂
  **One festive drink included with your $15 admission**\n🪩 Four hours o
 f music\, dancing\, and partying\n🌎 An opportunity to continue connecti
 ng with the amazing TILE international community\n❤️ Great music\, gre
 at people\, and unforgettable memories!\n\n### 📅 EVENT DETAILS\n\n**Dat
 e:** Saturday\, December 5\, 2026\n**Time:** 10 PM – 2 AM\n**Venue:** Lo
 bster Burger Bar\n**Address:** 214 King Street West\, Toronto\n**Admission
 :** $15 per person (includes one festive drink)\n\n### 🎉 MAKE IT A FULL
  NIGHT ON DEC. 5 2026!\n\n* **7:00 PM – 10:00 PM:** Join our regular TIL
 E International Language Exchange social at Madison Pub.\n* **10:00 PM –
  2:00 AM:** Head over to Lobster Burger Bar for the Christmas Rave Afterpa
 rty!\n\nCome for the language exchange\, stay for the friendships\, and fi
 nish the night dancing with us!\n\n🎟️ **RESERVE YOUR SPOT:**\n[https:
 //www.opentable.ca/booking/experiences-availability?rid=1090123&experience
 Id=852309&shareReferrer=web](https://www.opentable.ca/booking/experiences-
 availability?rid=1090123&experienceId=852309&shareReferrer=web)\n\nBring y
 our friends\, meet new people\, and let's celebrate the holiday season tog
 ether!\n\n#TILE #TorontoInternationalLanguageExchange #TorontoEvents #Toro
 ntoNightlife #TorontoRave #ChristmasPartyToronto #ChristmasRave #Electroni
 cDanceMusic #TorontoDJs #TorontoDecemberEvents
